[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item_data")
item_name = "Field Journal"
item_description = "A logging foreman's journal, the leather gone stiff with damp. The last entries are from 1974."
item_type = 1
note_text = "Field Journal — forestry camp, autumn 1974

The Institute men came up again today with their stakes and their orange tape. Seventeen stakes, in the hollow stumps all around the old cabin. I asked what for. \"Dormice,\" the tall one said, and wrote something down.

Three men gone since August. Not run off: gone, boots still by the bunks. The crew won't work past four now, and nobody walks out to the latrine alone.

Every night something comes to the edge of the lamplight and stands there. Tall, and crowned like an old bull elk. The lamps keep it back. Wave a torch at it and it screams and comes on.

The old man who built the cabin used to feed it, they say, at the willow. His son told me so before he left, and told me to keep the fires lit.

Board meeting Friday. I will tell them we are done here. Let the Institute have the cabin, and whatever it is they really came to count.

— K. Holm, foreman"
read_thought = "1974. Seventeen stakes, three men gone, and the Institute counting dormice."
scene_to_spawn = ExtResource("2_note_scene")
